  "method": "Both models use the same registry factory, default configuration and device. The reference calls the layer builder directly for the previous TorchScript representation. The candidate uses the public build_model default. A strict state_dict load makes weights identical for each pair. CPU pairs use seed 21. V100 pairs use the 1aa0f8b snapshot, built in FP32 before moving to the measured dtype. The training E/F comparison also carries the archived 1aa0f8b V100 outputs when available.",
